5	 * SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
6	 *
7	 * N8-B1/N8-B2 physical CPU2 secondary bootstrap.  NuttX creates the logical
8	 * CPU1 IDLE TCB and calls up_cpu_start(), but CPU2 remains parked before
9	 * nx_idle_trampoline().  N8-B2 optionally enables only the SDK-wrapped
10	 * bidirectional mailbox IPI path while the scheduler stays on logical CPU0.
11	 ****************************************************************************/
